# The generated design-system site. `npm run ds:site` rebuilds it from the
# markdown in seconds, and 12 of its 14 MB are copies of images already
# committed under docs/assets. The self-contained single-file HTML handovers
# in docs/ are NOT generated output in this sense — they are the deliverable
# that gets sent, and they stay in the repository.
docs/site
